WEBVTT

01:41.800 --> 01:48.990
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.490 --> 01:51.750
[Episode 9]

01:56.680 --> 01:58.509
You guys should be careful these days.

01:58.509 --> 01:59.710
I got mugged by two men

01:59.870 --> 02:01.430
on my way home yesterday.

02:03.790 --> 02:04.650
What happened?

02:05.510 --> 02:07.350
In that alley behind the school.

02:08.360 --> 02:09.620
You'd better avoid it.

02:10.520 --> 02:11.590
Who were they?

02:11.910 --> 02:12.840
No idea.

02:13.630 --> 02:15.080
They looked older than us.

02:15.080 --> 02:17.000
One of them had
a streak of dyed blond hair

02:17.000 --> 02:18.400
and looked quite fierce.

02:18.430 --> 02:20.079
Should we tell Ms. Kong first?

02:20.079 --> 02:20.960
What's the point?

02:20.960 --> 02:22.910
The teachers can't do anything about them.

02:22.910 --> 02:25.310
Besides, they're not even from our school.

02:41.360 --> 02:42.560
Fuxuan, you're here.

02:43.560 --> 02:45.240
Fuxuan, Li's been waiting for you.

02:45.240 --> 02:45.910
You're here, Fuxuan.

02:45.910 --> 02:46.400
Li.

02:46.400 --> 02:46.960
Sit.

02:48.870 --> 02:49.800
Have you eaten yet?

02:49.800 --> 02:50.630
Not yet.

02:50.870 --> 02:51.630
I've ordered quite a bit.

02:51.630 --> 02:52.800
Take a look
and see if you want anything else.

02:52.800 --> 02:53.800
We can order more.

02:54.190 --> 02:55.520
No need. This is plenty.

02:55.590 --> 02:56.680
Okay. Let's dig in.

02:59.680 --> 03:00.360
Here.

03:01.280 --> 03:01.940
Thanks, Li.

03:02.970 --> 03:03.360
Here.

03:03.360 --> 03:04.020
Thanks, Li.

03:07.680 --> 03:08.180
Fuxuan.

03:30.750 --> 03:31.400
What?

03:31.400 --> 03:32.360
Your classmate?

03:49.360 --> 03:50.840
Forget about him. Eat up.

03:54.190 --> 03:55.320
Have a skewer, here.

03:56.630 --> 03:57.430
Thanks, Li.

04:00.390 --> 04:06.560
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

04:10.780 --> 04:20.010
[A New Chapter, A New Journey]

04:19.040 --> 04:19.829
My wallet!

04:23.100 --> 04:24.750
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

04:24.070 --> 04:24.870
Shen Fuxuan,

04:25.120 --> 04:26.780
did anyone come here just now?

04:27.560 --> 04:28.310
No.

04:30.680 --> 04:31.480
Dongxu.

04:31.750 --> 04:33.360
My wallet somehow came back.

04:34.630 --> 04:35.720
This is so weird.

04:37.270 --> 04:38.390
Did anyone see

04:38.390 --> 04:39.830
who returned my wallet?

04:47.430 --> 04:48.240
Shen Fuxuan,

04:49.000 --> 04:50.040
you smoke?

04:55.240 --> 04:56.120
I don't.

05:01.160 --> 05:02.290
Good that you don't.

05:20.680 --> 05:24.000
[Grade 10 November Monthly Exam Rankings]

05:24.020 --> 05:25.140
[Campus Culture]

05:38.310 --> 05:39.909
As expected. Same as always.

05:43.880 --> 05:45.220
[1; Lin Zhixia] [2; Jiang Yubai]

05:45.260 --> 05:46.440
[3; Li Yuanyuan] [4; Zhao Li]

05:46.460 --> 05:47.290
[5; Jin Baihui] [6; Shen Fuxuan]

05:47.310 --> 05:48.260
[7; Li Zhijie] [8; Wang Xinrui]

05:48.280 --> 05:49.380
[9; Duan Qiyan] [10; Sun Lejun]

05:50.680 --> 05:51.630
I'm home.

05:52.510 --> 05:53.390
You're back.

05:55.600 --> 05:56.360
Go wash your hands first.

05:56.360 --> 05:57.690
Dinner's almost ready.

05:57.750 --> 05:58.390
Okay.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.040
Baihui.

06:01.480 --> 06:03.410
Are your monthly exam results out?

06:03.920 --> 06:05.050
The monthly exam...

06:05.830 --> 06:06.630
Not yet.

06:08.720 --> 06:09.720
That's strange.

06:10.560 --> 06:11.270
I remember last time

06:11.270 --> 06:14.000
your teacher released
the results very quickly.

06:14.510 --> 06:16.370
Why's it taking so long this time?

06:28.820 --> 06:29.310
Morning.

06:29.310 --> 06:29.950
Morning.

06:49.920 --> 06:50.800
Who did this?

06:51.430 --> 06:52.630
Who still pulls pranks like this?

06:52.630 --> 06:54.230
What is this, kindergarten?

07:07.560 --> 07:08.490
Here, wet wipes.

07:19.190 --> 07:20.270
Come on, move!

07:21.160 --> 07:22.510
Right, run around.

07:24.240 --> 07:25.040
Everyone take turns.

07:25.040 --> 07:25.720
Then

07:25.720 --> 07:27.480
try to hit whoever's in the middle.

07:27.480 --> 07:28.310
Everyone, aim at me.

07:28.310 --> 07:29.190
Just run around.

07:29.190 --> 07:30.120
Really, sir?

07:30.120 --> 07:32.650
Right, throw the ball at me,
and I'll dodge it.

07:48.120 --> 07:50.920
Still thinking about
what happened this morning?

07:53.950 --> 07:55.240
I don't know

07:55.240 --> 07:57.440
who exactly stuffed trash into my desk.

07:58.560 --> 08:00.160
And I don't know why, either.

08:03.390 --> 08:05.190
Actually, none of that matters.

08:06.800 --> 08:08.070
Whoever did it,

08:09.600 --> 08:11.060
whatever their reason...

08:12.600 --> 08:14.160
I'll find them.

08:17.480 --> 08:18.270
So...

08:19.630 --> 08:20.430
don't worry.

08:27.870 --> 08:29.160
That was hilarious.

08:29.160 --> 08:29.870
Did you see

08:29.870 --> 08:31.190
Duan Qiyan's throw in P.E. just now?

08:31.190 --> 08:33.520
It almost hit the P.E. teacher
in the face.

08:33.960 --> 08:35.960
Duan Qiyan turned white as a sheet.

08:36.000 --> 08:36.750
P.E. teacher...

08:36.750 --> 08:37.610
Don't sit down!

08:43.720 --> 08:44.510
Which psycho did this?

08:44.510 --> 08:46.640
Seriously, is this never going to end?

08:50.910 --> 08:51.720
What's wrong?

08:53.670 --> 08:54.720
I don't know

08:54.870 --> 08:56.400
who spilled ink on my chair.

08:57.030 --> 08:58.430
This is way over the line.

08:58.790 --> 08:59.630
Seriously, who did it?

08:59.630 --> 09:01.760
They'd better hope I don't catch them.

09:02.030 --> 09:03.510
Who could it be?

09:08.150 --> 09:10.210
Probably not someone from our class.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.390
We were all outside

09:11.440 --> 09:12.600
during P.E.

09:13.600 --> 09:15.200
Someone from another class?

09:15.360 --> 09:17.220
But you haven't offended anyone.

09:28.790 --> 09:29.600
Lin Zhixia.

09:30.870 --> 09:32.600
Mark my words.

09:34.150 --> 09:35.390
This isn't over.

09:43.870 --> 09:44.930
What are you doing?

09:46.510 --> 09:47.770
Why did you do all this?

09:48.600 --> 09:49.870
Do what?

09:50.030 --> 09:51.560
Who else could it be but you?

09:52.270 --> 09:53.720
Wanna hit me again, huh?

09:54.270 --> 09:56.600
If you hit me,
you'll be violating school rules.

09:56.600 --> 09:58.840
That counts as school violence, you know.

09:58.840 --> 09:59.790
Besides,

10:00.120 --> 10:01.780
what makes you think it was me?

10:02.000 --> 10:03.030
Who can prove it?

10:04.150 --> 10:05.480
If you suspect me,

10:05.840 --> 10:07.080
go tell the teacher.

10:07.270 --> 10:08.670
Have them come talk to me.

10:09.200 --> 10:10.860
I dare you to lay a finger on me.

10:11.320 --> 10:13.120
There's a security camera here.

10:15.080 --> 10:16.550
You eternal runner-up.

10:17.870 --> 10:20.400
If you don't want to
stay in school anymore...

10:21.670 --> 10:22.670
hit me right here.

10:25.240 --> 10:27.300
Kuang Geng, you'd better not push it.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.370
I'm telling you,

10:29.150 --> 10:31.210
if you pull anything like that again,

10:31.750 --> 10:33.480
I won't let you get away with it.

10:55.080 --> 10:55.870
Lin Zhixia.

10:56.550 --> 10:57.680
Let me walk you home.

10:58.240 --> 10:59.510
I'll be fine on my own.

10:59.870 --> 11:00.670
Better not.

11:01.030 --> 11:02.120
Given the special circumstances,

11:02.120 --> 11:03.670
you really shouldn't be by yourself.

11:03.670 --> 11:05.130
Is it really that serious?

11:08.390 --> 11:09.270
Lin Zhixia!

11:09.440 --> 11:10.240
Jiang Yubai!

11:10.440 --> 11:11.320
Wait for us.

11:13.550 --> 11:14.910
What are you guys doing here?

11:14.910 --> 11:16.750
Let's go home together after school.

11:16.750 --> 11:17.550
And me.

11:18.030 --> 11:19.200
With me escorting you,

11:19.200 --> 11:21.660
I guarantee no one will dare to
mess with you.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.200
Thanks, you guys.

11:23.910 --> 11:25.000
No need to thank us.

11:25.150 --> 11:26.630
You're my lifesaver.

11:26.630 --> 11:27.240
Besides,

11:27.240 --> 11:28.120
with something
this serious happening to you,

11:28.120 --> 11:29.360
I have to protect you.

11:29.510 --> 11:30.200
Come on,

11:30.200 --> 11:31.530
let's go home together.

11:32.110 --> 11:33.550
Look at you, trying to protect someone.

11:33.550 --> 11:34.910
I bet if anything actually happened,

11:34.910 --> 11:36.120
you'd probably be the first to run.

11:36.120 --> 11:36.980
Tang Tingting,

11:37.440 --> 11:39.550
I helped you outsmart the scalper before.

11:39.550 --> 11:40.960
How can you smear me like this?

11:40.960 --> 11:42.080
Have you no conscience?

11:42.080 --> 11:42.790
What do you mean, "you"?

11:42.790 --> 11:43.910
That was everyone's effort.

11:43.910 --> 11:44.720
Stop taking all the credit.

11:44.720 --> 11:45.750
It was me, okay?

11:45.750 --> 11:47.350
I came up with the idea first.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.020
What makes you think it was me?

12:01.150 --> 12:02.200
Who can prove it?

12:02.510 --> 12:03.840
If you suspect me,

12:04.200 --> 12:05.440
go tell the teacher.

12:05.720 --> 12:07.120
Have them come talk to me.

12:07.510 --> 12:10.040
If you don't want to
stay in school anymore...

12:11.150 --> 12:12.270
hit me right here.

12:26.320 --> 12:26.750
Hello.

12:27.550 --> 12:28.210
Duan Qiyan.

12:28.340 --> 12:29.000
Hey, Jiang.

12:29.480 --> 12:30.630
You should be...

12:31.030 --> 12:32.240
free today, right?

12:33.270 --> 12:34.080
Want to play basketball

12:34.080 --> 12:35.680
at the court near your place?

12:36.860 --> 12:38.240
My dad's home today.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.390
But he's going out for dinner,

12:40.390 --> 12:41.320
so later is fine.

12:42.270 --> 12:42.740
Okay.

12:43.360 --> 12:44.910
Then I'll come find you after dinner.

12:44.910 --> 12:46.170
Okay, see you tonight.

13:02.000 --> 13:02.720
He's here,

13:02.720 --> 13:03.440
Li.

13:08.240 --> 13:09.500
So, you're Kuang Geng?

13:09.550 --> 13:10.360
Yeah.

13:10.910 --> 13:11.840
Who are you?

13:12.790 --> 13:13.550
Sit.

13:18.550 --> 13:19.360
Don't be shy.

13:19.550 --> 13:21.550
Help yourself to whatever you want.

13:27.150 --> 13:28.510
I asked you here today

13:29.510 --> 13:30.910
for no particular reason.

13:30.910 --> 13:33.040
I just wanted to make friends with you.

13:35.390 --> 13:36.510
I have a brother.

13:36.720 --> 13:38.520
He goes to the same school as you.

13:38.910 --> 13:39.720
Your brother?

13:42.000 --> 13:42.840
Who is it?

13:43.150 --> 13:44.210
It doesn't matter.

13:44.750 --> 13:45.390
But

13:45.600 --> 13:47.080
I heard

13:47.750 --> 13:50.080
you've had
a bit of a conflict with him lately.

13:50.080 --> 13:51.000
Is that true?

13:54.120 --> 13:55.120
What do you want?

13:55.320 --> 13:56.360
I'm telling you,

13:56.360 --> 13:57.540
if anything happens to me,

13:57.540 --> 13:59.800
my dad will never
let you get away with it!

14:00.600 --> 14:01.320
Your dad?

14:03.030 --> 14:03.910
Relax.

14:04.340 --> 14:06.200
We didn't even do anything to you.

14:06.750 --> 14:07.440
Come on,

14:07.750 --> 14:08.810
let's have a drink.

14:10.600 --> 14:11.660
Pick up your glass!

14:14.960 --> 14:16.510
I'm a few years older than you,

14:16.510 --> 14:18.440
so I'll call you my little brother.

14:18.960 --> 14:21.030
We're all men, so I'll say it straight.

14:21.030 --> 14:22.840
I don't want any more of that nonsense

14:22.840 --> 14:24.480
reaching my ears.

14:25.630 --> 14:28.030
You need to
take my words to heart, brother.

14:28.120 --> 14:29.270
If I hear

14:29.270 --> 14:31.240
anything like that happening again,

14:31.240 --> 14:33.000
I won't be so nice next time.

14:33.910 --> 14:34.720
Okay?

14:35.840 --> 14:36.510
Cheers.

14:55.270 --> 14:56.790
Come on, eat up.

15:00.030 --> 15:02.160
Jiang, you really know the scene, huh?

15:02.440 --> 15:03.370
What do you mean?

15:03.720 --> 15:04.790
Not many people ask me

15:04.790 --> 15:06.650
to play at the court near my place.

15:07.200 --> 15:08.670
What's special about that court?

15:08.670 --> 15:09.840
There are a lot of skilled players there.

15:09.840 --> 15:11.840
I have to take this seriously today.

15:12.200 --> 15:12.870
It's just for fun—

15:12.870 --> 15:14.030
working up a sweat is enough.

15:14.030 --> 15:15.030
How can we do that?

15:15.270 --> 15:16.440
You came all this way

15:16.440 --> 15:17.510
to play basketball with me.

15:17.510 --> 15:19.510
I'll have to let you win
a dozen games in a row,

15:19.510 --> 15:20.240
at least.

15:20.240 --> 15:21.640
There's no need for that.

15:24.240 --> 15:24.870
I'll...

15:25.030 --> 15:26.560
go buy two bottles of water.

15:26.720 --> 15:27.630
Okay, let's go.

15:30.420 --> 15:33.300
[Fugui Mart]

15:34.270 --> 15:35.240
Okay, thanks.

15:36.150 --> 15:37.350
Why are you guys here?

15:37.550 --> 15:39.200
We're going to play basketball nearby,

15:39.200 --> 15:41.260
so we're passing by to buy some water.

15:41.440 --> 15:42.440
Take whatever you want.

15:42.440 --> 15:43.240
My treat.

15:43.550 --> 15:44.410
That generous?

15:44.510 --> 15:45.840
Don't mind if I do, then.

15:49.630 --> 15:51.830
Why did you come all the way here to play?

15:54.720 --> 15:56.030
I've heard for a long time

15:56.030 --> 15:57.550
that there are many skilled players here,

15:57.550 --> 15:59.750
so I wanted to
come and see how I stack up.

16:07.270 --> 16:08.750
If there's nothing important,

16:08.750 --> 16:10.240
you'd better stay home.

16:10.960 --> 16:11.840
It's safer.

16:16.000 --> 16:16.790
It's fine.

16:16.910 --> 16:18.840
This place is very close to my home.

16:20.670 --> 16:21.510
I got you this.

16:23.960 --> 16:25.360
Your brother's not here?

16:26.870 --> 16:27.670
I'm here.

16:29.120 --> 16:29.920
What's wrong?

16:30.910 --> 16:31.500
Brother,

16:31.630 --> 16:32.560
you're here too.

16:33.200 --> 16:34.000
Hello.

16:34.960 --> 16:35.600
Brother.

16:37.030 --> 16:38.000
Um, you guys...

16:38.270 --> 16:40.000
you guys just said something

16:40.510 --> 16:41.750
about not going out on weekends,

16:41.750 --> 16:42.720
that it's dangerous—

16:42.720 --> 16:43.650
what's going on?

16:45.600 --> 16:46.510
Because recently...

16:46.510 --> 16:47.320
It's nothing.

16:48.200 --> 16:49.630
Don't overreact.

16:50.000 --> 16:50.750
Go play basketball.

16:50.750 --> 16:51.810
It's getting late.

16:54.960 --> 16:55.870
Bye-bye, Brother!

16:55.870 --> 16:56.720
Bye, Brother!

17:02.840 --> 17:03.630
I think

17:03.720 --> 17:05.069
we should let your brother know.

17:05.069 --> 17:06.349
That way, there'd be one more person
looking out for you.

17:06.349 --> 17:07.069
No.

17:07.440 --> 17:09.200
My brother overthinks everything.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.550
If he knew,

17:10.640 --> 17:12.900
he definitely wouldn't be able to sleep.

17:15.270 --> 17:16.400
I've thought about it.

17:16.400 --> 17:17.160
If that person

17:17.160 --> 17:18.550
dared to confront me face-to-face,

17:18.550 --> 17:20.440
they wouldn't have done something

17:20.440 --> 17:22.640
like putting trash in my desk
in the first place.

17:22.640 --> 17:23.270
Don't worry.

17:23.270 --> 17:24.310
I'll be fine.

17:31.510 --> 17:32.200
Jiang,

17:32.590 --> 17:33.550
let's go then.

17:33.880 --> 17:34.920
We know everyone

17:34.960 --> 17:36.560
in the neighborhood anyway.

17:36.680 --> 17:37.960
Zhixia will be fine.

17:48.590 --> 17:49.400
One's out.

17:55.920 --> 17:56.720
Jiang,

17:57.400 --> 17:58.550
if you ask me,

17:58.960 --> 18:00.200
it's not unreasonable

18:00.200 --> 18:01.860
for you to suspect Kuang Geng.

18:02.750 --> 18:03.720
I mean,

18:03.720 --> 18:05.880
why won't that guy just stop?

18:06.920 --> 18:08.920
I must catch him in the act next time.

18:08.960 --> 18:10.690
Then he won't be able to deny it.

18:11.070 --> 18:12.270
That's it. That's it.

18:13.030 --> 18:14.030
You done playing?

18:14.110 --> 18:15.160
Next group! Next group!

18:15.160 --> 18:16.480
It's our turn. Let's go.

18:16.480 --> 18:17.310
You go ahead.

18:17.400 --> 18:18.200
I need a break.

18:18.480 --> 18:19.480
I'm going in then.

18:19.920 --> 18:20.480
Come on.

18:20.640 --> 18:21.240
Come on.

18:30.110 --> 18:31.000
Guard him!

18:36.220 --> 18:36.830
I'm on him.

18:41.830 --> 18:42.890
Can you get past me?

18:48.720 --> 18:49.440
Nice shot!

18:51.680 --> 18:53.030
-Nice!
-Nice shot!

18:58.640 --> 18:59.350
You okay, man?

18:59.350 --> 19:00.150
Sorry, sorry.

19:01.240 --> 19:02.400
Playing dirty, huh?

19:02.680 --> 19:03.880
That was a normal move.

19:03.880 --> 19:04.920
Are you crazy?

19:04.920 --> 19:06.160
You're the one who wanted it this rough!

19:06.160 --> 19:06.920
Don't, don't.

19:06.920 --> 19:07.920
You were playing dirty!

19:07.920 --> 19:08.790
How was I playing dirty?

19:08.790 --> 19:09.510
That was a normal move.

19:09.510 --> 19:10.440
You call that a normal move?

19:10.440 --> 19:12.440
That was normal! My hand was even up!

19:12.480 --> 19:13.830
Let go of me! Let go!

19:14.310 --> 19:15.590
Wait right here if you've got the guts.

19:15.590 --> 19:16.400
Don't leave!

19:16.720 --> 19:18.270
I'll stay right here and wait!

19:18.270 --> 19:19.480
Just wait right here.

19:20.240 --> 19:20.880
Isn't he crazy?

19:20.880 --> 19:21.880
That was a normal move.

19:21.880 --> 19:22.200
Crazy.

19:22.200 --> 19:23.200
Let's keep going.

19:23.510 --> 19:24.910
Come on. Let's continue.

19:25.110 --> 19:25.700
Maybe...

19:26.310 --> 19:27.590
we should head back first.

19:27.590 --> 19:28.590
It's fine, Jiang.

19:28.720 --> 19:30.000
That was a normal move.

19:30.000 --> 19:31.260
He's just a sore loser.

19:31.790 --> 19:32.390
It's fine.

19:33.000 --> 19:34.240
Come on. We just need one more player.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.000
We need one more player.

19:35.000 --> 19:35.460
Come on.

19:36.140 --> 19:36.440
Jiang.

19:36.440 --> 19:37.480
Spread out, spread out.

19:37.480 --> 19:38.080
It's okay.

19:44.680 --> 19:46.080
Come on. Let's continue.

19:46.680 --> 19:47.440
Come on, come on.

19:47.440 --> 19:48.270
Spread out over there.

19:48.270 --> 19:48.930
Spread out.

20:04.440 --> 20:05.240
Li.

20:05.790 --> 20:06.790
This is the place.

20:14.680 --> 20:15.030
Hey!

20:22.720 --> 20:23.480
Your friends?

20:23.480 --> 20:24.070
No.

20:24.070 --> 20:25.870
Isn't that the guy from just now?

20:29.160 --> 20:30.110
Shen Fuxuan?

20:31.240 --> 20:32.030
Li,

20:32.550 --> 20:33.440
it's this kid.

20:40.310 --> 20:41.110
Li,

20:42.000 --> 20:43.330
they're my classmates.

20:43.960 --> 20:45.830
Is there some kind of misunderstanding?

20:45.830 --> 20:46.640
Classmates?

20:48.350 --> 20:49.160
Fine.

20:50.310 --> 20:51.570
Your classmates, huh?

20:52.200 --> 20:53.260
What are you doing?

20:54.960 --> 20:56.000
How could you slap him?

20:56.000 --> 20:56.880
We're even now.

20:57.720 --> 20:59.450
I went easy on him for your sake.

21:00.200 --> 21:00.830
Wait...

21:01.270 --> 21:02.070
Wait...

21:02.070 --> 21:02.590
What was that?

21:02.590 --> 21:03.200
What the heck was that?

21:03.200 --> 21:04.440
How could you slap him?

21:04.440 --> 21:05.240
-No.
-Back off!

21:05.240 --> 21:06.400
-Don't move!
-How could you slap him?

21:06.400 --> 21:07.880
Calm down. Calm down!

21:07.960 --> 21:09.240
-What?
-How could you slap him?

21:09.240 --> 21:09.920
Calm down.

21:09.920 --> 21:10.440
Come at me, then!

21:10.440 --> 21:11.160
Calm down!

21:11.160 --> 21:12.360
They've got weapons!

21:17.920 --> 21:18.720
Li,

21:18.880 --> 21:19.880
I'll handle this.

21:20.880 --> 21:21.420
Let's go.

21:23.090 --> 21:24.240
You'd better behave.

21:24.240 --> 21:24.970
Are you okay?

21:25.270 --> 21:25.880
Let's go home. Let's go.

21:25.880 --> 21:26.510
Forget it.

21:26.510 --> 21:28.510
-Let's call it a day.
-Let's go home.

21:31.750 --> 21:32.550
So...

21:33.640 --> 21:35.240
those guys are your friends?

21:38.480 --> 21:39.240
Jiang.

21:40.790 --> 21:41.510
Forget it.

21:41.680 --> 21:42.920
No, how can we just forget it?

21:42.920 --> 21:44.000
How could they slap you?

21:44.000 --> 21:45.590
They've got weapons.

21:45.720 --> 21:47.240
And we're still students.

21:49.240 --> 21:49.960
This...

21:49.960 --> 21:51.790
this is my fault for being too hot-headed.

21:51.790 --> 21:53.400
If I'd listened to you

21:53.550 --> 21:54.240
and left earlier,

21:54.240 --> 21:56.040
none of this would've happened.

21:57.510 --> 21:59.310
Just consider it my loss to take.

22:01.720 --> 22:03.380
Taking a loss isn't a big deal.

22:04.000 --> 22:05.270
But I never expected

22:05.550 --> 22:06.810
that our own classmate

22:07.480 --> 22:09.010
would side with outsiders.

22:11.270 --> 22:12.640
If I hadn't known them,

22:13.000 --> 22:14.270
this wouldn't have ended so easily.

22:14.270 --> 22:15.000
So you mean

22:15.000 --> 22:16.660
we should be thanking you now?

22:18.070 --> 22:19.070
I didn't mean that.

22:19.070 --> 22:19.600
I just...

22:21.240 --> 22:21.900
Duan Qiyan.

22:23.790 --> 22:24.480
Let's go.

22:37.670 --> 22:43.920
[Awards Board]

22:47.160 --> 22:47.960
Duan Qiyan,

22:48.270 --> 22:49.870
I bought a bottle for you too.

22:51.000 --> 22:51.920
I'm sorry.

22:53.750 --> 22:54.810
I have my own water.

22:54.920 --> 22:55.750
Thanks.

23:04.920 --> 23:05.720
Duan Qiyan.

23:06.510 --> 23:07.640
Let's go to the convenience store.

23:07.550 --> 23:08.870
[Pursue Knowledge, Seek Truth;
Practice Diligently, Foster Innovation]

23:07.960 --> 23:08.590
Come on.

23:57.830 --> 23:59.560
What's wrong with Shen Fuxuan?

24:01.590 --> 24:03.790
Did something happen between you guys?

24:04.790 --> 24:05.590
Nothing.

24:30.370 --> 24:36.660
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

25:09.680 --> 25:10.400
Hello, Li.

25:11.110 --> 25:12.400
Hey, Fuxuan.

25:12.590 --> 25:14.160
Let's play pool tonight.

25:15.830 --> 25:17.310
I'll pass tonight.

25:17.830 --> 25:19.200
What have you been up to lately?

25:19.200 --> 25:20.310
I've asked you to hang out several times,

25:20.310 --> 25:21.710
but I never get to see you.

25:24.790 --> 25:25.720
I've been...

25:26.440 --> 25:27.170
busy lately.

25:28.640 --> 25:29.570
I'll hang up now.

26:03.310 --> 26:04.000
Zhixia,

26:04.750 --> 26:05.790
I think

26:06.350 --> 26:09.200
there's
definitely something wrong with them.

26:09.680 --> 26:11.480
Even Wan Chunlei couldn't
dig up any gossip about them.

26:11.480 --> 26:13.280
Do you realize how weird that is?

26:14.110 --> 26:15.970
There must be something going on.

26:17.160 --> 26:19.030
Otherwise, why would things be so weird
between them?

26:19.030 --> 26:19.830
Exactly.

26:20.790 --> 26:21.590
I'll go ask.

26:24.750 --> 26:25.550
Lin Zhixia.

26:25.550 --> 26:26.350
Jiang Yubai.

26:27.070 --> 26:28.400
Sui wants to see you two.

26:28.880 --> 26:30.750
I saw Director Sui looking serious.

26:30.750 --> 26:32.210
You two better be careful.

26:50.440 --> 26:51.550
Do you know

26:51.550 --> 26:53.610
why I asked you two to come here today?

26:59.400 --> 27:00.920
Kuang Geng's parents

27:00.960 --> 27:02.270
called us

27:02.350 --> 27:03.400
and said that
a few days ago, after school,

27:03.400 --> 27:04.750
Kuang Geng was cornered at the school gate

27:04.750 --> 27:06.400
by some street punks.

27:07.400 --> 27:08.310
Did you two

27:08.350 --> 27:09.440
know about this?

27:10.830 --> 27:11.640
No.

27:14.880 --> 27:15.610
Jiang Yubai,

27:16.000 --> 27:16.750
did you know?

27:21.030 --> 27:22.360
You didn't know either?

27:23.590 --> 27:25.400
Then why is Kuang Geng insisting

27:25.510 --> 27:26.750
that those punks

27:26.790 --> 27:28.090
were sent by you?

27:30.700 --> 27:31.270
I...

27:31.680 --> 27:33.160
I didn't send anyone.

27:34.750 --> 27:35.960
That's strange.

27:36.590 --> 27:37.590
Then is there any conflict

27:37.590 --> 27:38.880
between you and Kuang Geng?

27:38.880 --> 27:39.780
Director Sui,

27:39.960 --> 27:41.240
have you asked Kuang Geng

27:41.240 --> 27:42.640
why we have a conflict?

27:42.920 --> 27:44.510
He was clearly in the wrong first.

27:44.510 --> 27:46.160
He's been bullying Lin Zhixia
this whole time.

27:46.160 --> 27:48.290
Let's put what happened before aside.

27:48.640 --> 27:50.440
If those street punks
were really sent by you

27:50.440 --> 27:52.270
to corner Kuang Geng,

27:52.510 --> 27:53.960
do you know how serious this is?

27:53.960 --> 27:55.880
That counts as
a serious disciplinary violation.

27:55.880 --> 27:57.000
It will stay on your record

27:57.000 --> 27:58.400
for the rest of your life.

28:00.590 --> 28:01.270
Director.

28:01.640 --> 28:02.440
Come in.

28:07.640 --> 28:08.310
Director,

28:08.790 --> 28:09.590
I was the one

28:10.350 --> 28:11.680
who called those people.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.480
What?

28:13.790 --> 28:14.920
How did you end up mixed up

28:14.920 --> 28:15.920
with those punks?

28:16.350 --> 28:17.790
He went too far,

28:17.940 --> 28:19.550
so I had people warn him.

28:20.400 --> 28:21.600
For someone like him,

28:22.310 --> 28:24.240
that's the only method that works.

28:24.930 --> 28:26.510
Shen Fuxuan, oh, Shen Fuxuan,

28:26.510 --> 28:28.350
I really never expected this.

28:28.480 --> 28:30.790
I can't believe
you'd get mixed up with people like that

28:30.790 --> 28:32.270
and even call them

28:32.590 --> 28:34.880
to threaten a fellow student.

28:35.110 --> 28:36.910
What exactly were you thinking?

28:36.960 --> 28:37.640
Do you have any idea

28:37.640 --> 28:39.070
how serious this is?

28:39.400 --> 28:41.070
Do you understand
what this actually constitutes?

28:41.070 --> 28:42.640
Does your mother, Professor Shen,

28:42.640 --> 28:44.700
know you have connections with them?

28:48.640 --> 28:49.440
This isn't a small matter.

28:49.440 --> 28:50.590
Have your mother come to school tomorrow.

28:50.590 --> 28:51.720
I need to talk to her.

28:52.960 --> 28:53.820
Unbelievable.

29:08.510 --> 29:09.400
Shen Fuxuan.

29:20.750 --> 29:21.750
I'm really sorry.

29:22.830 --> 29:24.350
Because of Kuang Geng,

29:24.480 --> 29:26.140
you got your parent called in.

29:27.830 --> 29:28.510
It's fine.

29:29.880 --> 29:31.410
My mom probably won't come.

29:31.640 --> 29:32.430
Why?

29:34.440 --> 29:36.440
She's still away on a business trip.

29:38.400 --> 29:39.270
I'm used to it.

29:40.920 --> 29:41.680
Actually, we don't

29:41.680 --> 29:43.140
spend much time together.

29:44.510 --> 29:45.850
She just leaves some money at home

29:45.850 --> 29:47.850
to make sure I don't starve to death.

29:50.240 --> 29:51.370
I don't even know...

29:52.700 --> 29:54.430
when we'll see each other next.

29:59.720 --> 30:01.160
If this hadn't happened,

30:02.030 --> 30:03.230
I wouldn't have known

30:04.350 --> 30:05.750
you'd always been alone.

30:09.880 --> 30:11.110
My life

30:12.110 --> 30:12.880
has always been

30:12.880 --> 30:15.000
arranged by my parents since childhood.

30:15.000 --> 30:16.030
I've been stuck walking

30:16.030 --> 30:18.160
the path they've tested and approved.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.940
They want me to be like them
in the future.

30:23.400 --> 30:26.130
But what's so interesting
about doing research?

30:29.160 --> 30:29.960
Actually...

30:32.070 --> 30:34.070
I still prefer dealing with people.

30:35.350 --> 30:36.310
When I

30:36.590 --> 30:38.070
first met those guys,

30:39.640 --> 30:40.270
I also thought

30:40.270 --> 30:41.510
they were just wasting their days

30:41.510 --> 30:42.370
doing nothing.

30:43.960 --> 30:45.620
But later, I realized that...

30:46.680 --> 30:48.200
this kind of life—having no goals

30:48.200 --> 30:50.200
and hanging out together every day—

30:52.680 --> 30:53.740
is quite relaxing.

30:57.590 --> 30:58.640
In our parents' eyes,

30:58.640 --> 31:00.040
we're always still kids.

31:01.310 --> 31:03.030
Maybe Professor Shen
really has overlooked the fact

31:03.030 --> 31:04.160
that you've grown up

31:05.000 --> 31:07.260
and want to see a different kind of world.

31:09.830 --> 31:10.510
Every boy

31:10.510 --> 31:12.770
probably goes through a stage like this,

31:12.880 --> 31:14.880
wanting to hang out with older guys.

31:16.270 --> 31:18.130
Even just walking alongside them

31:18.640 --> 31:19.790
makes you feel cool

31:20.510 --> 31:21.440
and impressive.

31:26.310 --> 31:27.710
But actually, I know too.

31:29.480 --> 31:30.880
They only hang out with me

31:32.150 --> 31:33.350
because I have money.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.370
My parents use money

31:38.110 --> 31:40.310
to ease their guilt over neglecting me.

31:41.200 --> 31:42.260
And I use that money

31:43.790 --> 31:45.720
to buy my friends' companionship.

31:47.030 --> 31:48.030
This exchange...

31:49.720 --> 31:51.650
is actually pretty fair, isn't it?

31:56.510 --> 31:57.590
I understand you.

32:00.590 --> 32:02.920
I didn't have many friends before either.

32:03.240 --> 32:04.840
Back then, in order to fit in,

32:05.200 --> 32:06.790
I explained problems to them

32:06.790 --> 32:08.850
and even did their homework for them.

32:09.070 --> 32:10.400
But none of it worked.

32:11.750 --> 32:13.950
I was pretty frustrated for a while too.

32:14.070 --> 32:16.070
It wasn't until I met my true friends

32:16.070 --> 32:17.720
that I stopped trying to please others

32:17.720 --> 32:19.030
just to make friends.

32:21.960 --> 32:22.720
So,

32:22.750 --> 32:25.070
I haven't been in contact with
those people for a long time.

32:25.070 --> 32:26.310
What happened recently

32:26.310 --> 32:27.240
made me realize

32:27.680 --> 32:30.080
that we're just
not the same kind of people.

32:32.400 --> 32:33.350
Real friends

32:34.550 --> 32:35.750
give you strength...

32:38.310 --> 32:39.640
and make you feel warmth

32:40.070 --> 32:40.920
and joy.

32:44.750 --> 32:45.550
Lin Zhixia,

32:46.200 --> 32:47.330
let me walk you home.

32:47.830 --> 32:48.640
And me.

32:49.110 --> 32:50.270
With me escorting you,

32:50.270 --> 32:52.730
I guarantee
no one will dare to mess with you.

32:53.270 --> 32:54.270
Thanks, you guys.

32:54.440 --> 32:55.440
Officer!

32:55.790 --> 32:57.850
It's him. He's selling fake tickets!

32:58.010 --> 32:58.850
Deal.

32:59.180 --> 33:00.010
Deal.

33:18.400 --> 33:19.200
Has anyone...

33:20.720 --> 33:22.250
ever made you feel that way?

33:25.110 --> 33:26.110
Before, no.

33:27.920 --> 33:28.920
But now, yes.

33:33.200 --> 33:34.800
Including you, Shen Fuxuan.

33:38.830 --> 33:40.640
Do you remember telling me

33:41.310 --> 33:42.170
that teammates

33:42.640 --> 33:43.640
are also friends?

33:45.160 --> 33:47.020
But we're not teammates anymore.

33:48.750 --> 33:50.410
We're not teammates anymore.

33:51.790 --> 33:52.880
So now, we are

33:53.000 --> 33:54.270
real friends.

33:55.310 --> 33:56.000
Friends?

33:57.960 --> 33:58.640
Friends.

34:04.550 --> 34:05.160
Friends.

34:48.070 --> 34:49.800
Hello, is this Professor Shen?

34:50.800 --> 34:51.800
This is Zhixia.

34:52.960 --> 34:55.760
There are some things
I'd like to talk to you about.

35:04.320 --> 35:05.630
Everyone, pay attention.

35:05.630 --> 35:07.550
This is a giveaway question.

35:09.150 --> 35:10.800
A is obviously wrong,

35:11.000 --> 35:12.460
B is definitely wrong too,

35:12.510 --> 35:14.000
and C doesn't match the requirements.

35:14.000 --> 35:15.110
So the answer is D.

35:15.110 --> 35:16.030
Got it?

35:29.590 --> 35:30.230
Li.

35:37.440 --> 35:38.030
Fuxuan,

35:38.550 --> 35:39.880
why did you stop contacting us?

35:39.880 --> 35:41.630
Trying to become a model student now?

35:41.630 --> 35:43.920
You wouldn't even come when we called you.

35:43.920 --> 35:46.780
You don't even think of us
as brothers anymore, huh?

35:47.550 --> 35:49.350
I've helped you a lot, haven't I?

35:49.710 --> 35:51.670
Last time you asked us to
talk to your schoolmate,

35:51.670 --> 35:52.670
we did, didn't we?

35:53.880 --> 35:54.810
And before that,

35:54.880 --> 35:55.920
your classmate's wallet—

35:55.920 --> 35:57.850
you asked me to return it, and I did.

35:58.880 --> 36:00.440
I treated you like my little brother.

36:00.440 --> 36:01.630
Good food, drinks, fun stuff—

36:01.630 --> 36:03.230
when did I ever leave you out?

36:04.000 --> 36:06.130
Now you just don't contact us anymore.

36:06.440 --> 36:09.170
So all that time we spent together
meant nothing?

36:11.800 --> 36:12.480
Li,

36:13.280 --> 36:15.000
we did hang out together before,

36:15.000 --> 36:17.330
but I never treated you guys badly either.

36:17.480 --> 36:18.280
Meals, drinks, pool—

36:18.280 --> 36:20.070
-I paid for all of it.
-Shen Fuxuan,

36:20.070 --> 36:21.550
don't push your luck!

36:21.760 --> 36:24.290
Are you trying to
settle the accounts with Li?

36:26.590 --> 36:27.300
Don't go too far.

36:27.300 --> 36:27.840
Fine.

36:33.630 --> 36:34.830
Something happened!

36:35.280 --> 36:36.590
Go check it out quickly.

36:36.590 --> 36:37.440
Shen Fuxuan

36:37.440 --> 36:39.240
is being cornered by some punks.

36:40.800 --> 36:41.630
Cornered?

36:42.110 --> 36:42.710
Yes.

36:42.800 --> 36:43.760
And those same two guys from before

36:43.760 --> 36:45.670
who robbed my wallet are there too.

36:45.670 --> 36:47.480
Aren't those people Shen Fuxuan's friends?

36:47.480 --> 36:48.230
No.

36:48.920 --> 36:49.960
Shen Fuxuan told me

36:49.960 --> 36:52.160
he cut contact with them a long time ago.

36:52.870 --> 36:53.580
This is bad.

36:54.280 --> 36:54.960
Let's go.

36:55.360 --> 36:56.070
Let's go.

37:03.510 --> 37:04.110
Fine,

37:04.280 --> 37:05.630
you want to settle the accounts?

37:05.630 --> 37:07.490
Then let's settle them properly.

37:07.630 --> 37:09.480
Kuang Geng's matter and the previous one,

37:09.480 --> 37:10.800
1,000 yuan each.

37:11.070 --> 37:12.280
That's 2,000 in total.

37:12.280 --> 37:13.590
You give us the money,

37:13.630 --> 37:14.890
and we'll call it even.

37:16.400 --> 37:18.260
I don't have that much money on me.

37:19.230 --> 37:20.000
Alright,

37:20.440 --> 37:21.570
no money is fine too.

37:21.670 --> 37:22.710
We're brothers, after all.

37:22.710 --> 37:24.310
So I won't ask for your money.

37:24.920 --> 37:25.670
But you have to let me

37:25.670 --> 37:27.030
slap you 20 times.

37:27.590 --> 37:29.190
Then this'll be settled too.

37:32.840 --> 37:34.320
For old times' sake,

37:35.110 --> 37:36.190
I'll go easy on you.

37:37.550 --> 37:39.280
I'll spare you some suffering.

37:40.000 --> 37:40.760
Stop!

37:48.960 --> 37:49.760
Let him go!

37:52.880 --> 37:54.230
Just the few of you?

37:54.840 --> 37:55.760
Students?

37:58.960 --> 38:00.090
Looking for a fight?

38:00.440 --> 38:01.230
Come on!

38:10.190 --> 38:11.230
And us too.

38:24.880 --> 38:25.510
Li,

38:25.530 --> 38:26.340
let's just drop it.

38:26.340 --> 38:27.150
Don't move!

39:07.480 --> 39:11.010
That was one of the few times
we ever saw Shen Fuxuan truly moved.

39:11.530 --> 39:14.590
We were all in high spirits,
as if we'd just won a battle.

39:15.570 --> 39:16.190
Later,

39:16.500 --> 39:17.960
the school contacted the police

39:17.960 --> 39:19.490
and dealt with those punks.

39:20.340 --> 39:21.760
But we still felt

39:22.360 --> 39:25.020
that we were the big heroes
who saved our friend.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.640
Fuxuan, you're back.

40:05.960 --> 40:06.960
Sit down and eat.

40:07.630 --> 40:08.690
You must be hungry.

40:14.510 --> 40:15.440
Mom made

40:15.800 --> 40:17.060
seafood congee today.

40:17.670 --> 40:18.670
You know I'm...

40:19.280 --> 40:21.030
not very good at cooking.

40:21.030 --> 40:21.670
You...

40:22.230 --> 40:23.320
You... You...

40:23.320 --> 40:24.110
Try it.

40:42.550 --> 40:43.440
Is it good?

40:47.610 --> 40:48.480
It's good.

40:52.230 --> 40:53.560
Have some of the dishes.

41:00.320 --> 41:01.720
You should have some too.

41:19.480 --> 41:20.880
It's too salty, isn't it?

41:21.480 --> 41:22.280
No.

41:23.950 --> 41:25.210
I'll go get some water.

41:25.760 --> 41:26.550
It's okay.
